                <head>No. 277.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cushing to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-08-23"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 23,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>Matter of Burriel is under discussion between minister of state and myself. Copy
                    of note and report of several personal interviews by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed>CUSHING.</signed></closer>
            </div>
